        "original_id": "12993d39-9630-5b64-a9a6-eb8dae41d14a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Hôtel de Crillon, Place de la Concorde, Champs-Élysées, Paris, France\n- Buildings and Monuments: Hotel de la Marine, Luxor Obelisk\n- Events: 7th Lumières Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Place de la Concorde is one of the major public squares in Paris, France.\n- Hôtel de Crillon is located at the foot of the Champs-Élysées on the Place de la Concorde in Paris.\n- Hôtel de Crillon and Hotel de la Marine are two identical stone palaces on the Place de la Concorde.\n- The Luxor Obelisk is a 23-meter-high Egyptian obelisk standing at the center of the Place de la Concorde in Paris, France.\n- The winners of the 7th Lumières Awards were announced at a press conference at the Hôtel de Crillon in Paris.",
